{
  "name": "@dawn/dsh-auto-evolve",
  "version": "0.3.1",
  "description": "DSH 自进化宿主插件（M3-a）：每累计 N 次工具调用，导出会话并 detached 拉起 bg-review；bg-review 两段式审查后直接写技能库（不再产草稿等人审）；session-start 注入待审清单；持续写 plugin-heartbeat.json。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/mock-ctx.mjs && node test/import-smoke.mjs"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
